{"id":1535,"date":"2023-02-11T10:06:44","date_gmt":"2023-02-11T00:36:44","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/?p=1535"},"modified":"2023-05-13T08:13:18","modified_gmt":"2023-05-12T22:43:18","slug":"how-to-optimize-shopping-feeds","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/how-to-optimize-shopping-feeds\/","title":{"rendered":"How To Optimize Shopping Feeds: What To Do First"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"1535\" class=\"elementor elementor-1535\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2b81d4b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"2b81d4b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e534e6b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e534e6b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Learning how to optimize shopping feeds<\/h2><p>Prioritizing feed issues is important when asking how to optimize shopping feeds. With limited time and resources, it can be tough to focus on every issue at once. Prioritization helps to identify the most critical problems and tackle them first. This ensures that the most important issues are looked at and resolved quickly.<\/p><p>Optimizing shopping feeds is crucial to performance of ads.\u00a0 Accurate and complete shopping ads ensure that customers can find and buy the products they want. This leads to more traffic and higher sales. By prioritizing feed issues and optimizing shopping feeds, businesses can stay competitive and achieve desired results.<\/p><p>While it may be hard to learn how to optimize product feeds, it is possible. Resources such as tutorials, webinars, and this blog are available to help businesses improve their technical knowledge and skills. Investing time in learning how to optimize shopping feeds is an investment that can pay off in increased revenue.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a579099 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a579099\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Introducing the FeedOps Playbook: Prioritizing Optimozation<\/h2><p>The <a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/why-feedops\/\">FeedOps Playbook<\/a> is a valuable resource for anyone looking to optimize shopping feeds. Product feed management can be a hard task, especially for marketers or retail business owners with limited time and resources. The FeedOps Playbook offers easy to follow guide on the important optimization tasks and instructions on how to fix them.<\/p><p>With the FeedOps Playbook, users have all the tools they need to make changes and improve their shopping feeds. The FeedOps Playbook helps uses prioritize the most important issues and optimize their feeds for maximum performance. By working on the tasks in The FeedOps Playbook, users can increase their sales and revenue.<\/p><p>The FeedOps Playbook is accessible on a <a href=\"https:\/\/app.feedops.com\/sign_up\">Free FeedOps account<\/a>, making it an affordable solution for retailers of all sizes. Whether you&#8217;re new to product feed management a seasoned pro, or <a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/become-a-feedops-agency\/\">an agency<\/a>, the FeedOps Playbook is an essential resource that can help you optimize your shopping feeds and achieve e-commerce success.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-490b8f1 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"490b8f1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-55c7b95 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"55c7b95\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1d69571 elementor-drop-cap-yes elementor-drop-cap-view-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1d69571\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;drop_cap&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>The &#8220;How To Optimize Shopping Feeds&#8221; Optimization Score<\/h2><p>\u00a0<\/p><p>The new health status and optimization score system help users easily understand their product data status. The system uses a color-code (green for good, orange for warning, and red for urgent) to assess data health.<\/p><p>The optimization score feature provides users with a clear view of how well their product data is optimized. The score is updated every time a change is made, such as adding or removing a product, so users always have the most current information about their data quality<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-073b4bd elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"073b4bd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"622\" height=\"340\" src=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/FeedOps-Feed-Optimization-Score.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-1549\" alt=\"Feed Optimization Score\" srcset=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/FeedOps-Feed-Optimization-Score.png 622w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/FeedOps-Feed-Optimization-Score-300x164.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 622px) 100vw, 622px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1e4be68 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1e4be68\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ed2b568 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ed2b568\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>The &#8220;How To Optimize Shopping Feeds&#8221; Job Cards<\/h2><p>Feed optimization job cards are a tool for users to improve the quality of their product data ad performance. These cards prioritize optimization activities based on their potential to improve the optimization score of the product data.<\/p><p>Each card focuses on a specific optimization task. Such as, adding missing size or color attributes or improving product titles, descriptions, or product types using FeedOps AI suggestions. This approach provides users with a clear roadmap for optimizing their product data. This also saves valuable time by allowing them users to edit individual products or make bulk edits quickly.<\/p><p>Moreover, the job cards include a link to a filtered view of affected products that require attention, allowing users to prioritize the most pressing optimization tasks first. By completing the optimization tasks outlined in the job cards, users can achieve better ROAS and drive more sales through their advertising efforts.<\/p><p>Overall, with FeedOps&#8217; comprehensive approach to feed optimization, e-commerce businesses can stay competitive in the market and attract more potential customers. Feed optimization job cards are an essential tool for any user seeking to maximize the potential of their product data and improve the performance of their ads.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dfabc45 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"dfabc45\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"690\" height=\"666\" src=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/FeedOps-Optimization-Cards.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-1550\" alt=\"Feed Optimization cards\" srcset=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/FeedOps-Optimization-Cards.png 690w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/FeedOps-Optimization-Cards-300x290.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 690px) 100vw, 690px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-864fe88 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"864fe88\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Maximize Your Advertising Outcomes with FeedOps<\/h2><p>By signing up for FeedOps&#8217; free account, you&#8217;ll gain access to invaluable knowledge about feed optimization, which can help improve your advertising outcomes. In our free account, you&#8217;ll find a wealth of information and guidance on how to optimize your product data feed.<\/p><p>You can take your time and fix feed issues at your own pace. Moreover, if you need help, you can contact us to discuss our affordable fees. Our team of experts can provide tailored recommendations to suit your business needs.<\/p><p>At FeedOps, our goal is to help marketers better understand how to optimize their product data for better advertising outcomes. That&#8217;s why our free account is a perfect starting point.<\/p><p>So, if you&#8217;re looking to improve your advertising performance and increase sales, sign up for FeedOps&#8217; free account today. Take the first step towards better feed optimization and see the positive impact it can have on your business.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Work on the most important feed optimization tasks first using the FeedOps Playbook. The FeedOps Playbook now has health check and optimization scores to help you identify problems and opportunities. Product data feeds provide the fuel that powers product level advertising programs such as Shopping Ads, Pmax and Dynamic Remarketing Ads. If you want to improve your return on ad spend, feed optimization is what you need to be doing.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":9,"featured_media":1541,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"content-type":"","footnotes":""},"categories":[1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-1535","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-uncategorized"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v26.6 (Yoast SEO v26.6) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>How To Optimize Shopping Feeds: What To Do First - FeedOps<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Asking how to optimize shopping feeds is crucial for performance marketers. Doing so helps increase online sales.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/how-to-optimize-shopping-feeds\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"How To Optimize Shopping Feeds: What To Do First\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Asking how to optimize shopping feeds is crucial for performance marketers. Doing so helps increase online sales.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/how-to-optimize-shopping-feeds\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"FeedOps\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/feedops\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2023-02-11T00:36:44+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2023-05-12T22:43:18+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/feedops-playbook-with-optimiszation-score-4-scaled.jpeg\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"2560\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"1902\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image\/jpeg\" \/>\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Frank Grasso\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"Frank Grasso\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label2\" content=\"Est. reading time\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data2\" content=\"4 minutes\" \/>\n<script type=\"application\/ld+json\" class=\"yoast-schema-graph\">{\"@context\":\"https:\/\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/how-to-optimize-shopping-feeds\/#article\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/how-to-optimize-shopping-feeds\/\"},\"author\":{\"name\":\"Frank Grasso\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#\/schema\/person\/935d648bb8def3c2afc809a576755608\"},\"headline\":\"How To Optimize Shopping Feeds: What To Do First\",\"datePublished\":\"2023-02-11T00:36:44+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2023-05-12T22:43:18+00:00\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/how-to-optimize-shopping-feeds\/\"},\"wordCount\":788,\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#organization\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/how-to-optimize-shopping-feeds\/#primaryimage\"},\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/feedops-playbook-with-optimiszation-score-4-scaled.jpeg\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/how-to-optimize-shopping-feeds\/\",\"url\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/how-to-optimize-shopping-feeds\/\",\"name\":\"How To Optimize Shopping Feeds: What To Do First - FeedOps\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#website\"},\"primaryImageOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/how-to-optimize-shopping-feeds\/#primaryimage\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/how-to-optimize-shopping-feeds\/#primaryimage\"},\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/feedops-playbook-with-optimiszation-score-4-scaled.jpeg\",\"datePublished\":\"2023-02-11T00:36:44+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2023-05-12T22:43:18+00:00\",\"description\":\"Asking how to optimize shopping feeds is crucial for performance marketers. Doing so helps increase online sales.\",\"breadcrumb\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/how-to-optimize-shopping-feeds\/#breadcrumb\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"ReadAction\",\"target\":[\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/how-to-optimize-shopping-feeds\/\"]}]},{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/how-to-optimize-shopping-feeds\/#primaryimage\",\"url\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/feedops-playbook-with-optimiszation-score-4-scaled.jpeg\",\"contentUrl\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/feedops-playbook-with-optimiszation-score-4-scaled.jpeg\",\"width\":2560,\"height\":1902},{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/how-to-optimize-shopping-feeds\/#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"How To Optimize Shopping Feeds: What To Do First\"}]},{\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#website\",\"url\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/\",\"name\":\"FeedOps\",\"description\":\"\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#organization\"},\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"SearchAction\",\"target\":{\"@type\":\"EntryPoint\",\"urlTemplate\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/?s={search_term_string}\"},\"query-input\":{\"@type\":\"PropertyValueSpecification\",\"valueRequired\":true,\"valueName\":\"search_term_string\"}}],\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#organization\",\"name\":\"FeedOps\",\"url\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#\/schema\/logo\/image\/\",\"url\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/Feedops-staggered-logo_Final-2-e1653522818889.png\",\"contentUrl\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/Feedops-staggered-logo_Final-2-e1653522818889.png\",\"width\":899,\"height\":929,\"caption\":\"FeedOps\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#\/schema\/logo\/image\/\"},\"sameAs\":[\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/feedops\",\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/feedops\/\",\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/@feedops\"]},{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#\/schema\/person\/935d648bb8def3c2afc809a576755608\",\"name\":\"Frank Grasso\",\"image\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#\/schema\/person\/image\/\",\"url\":\"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/10729b10d31fe46be449737d0a25a76598f7994e4b44a67056563d0715c3fa71?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"contentUrl\":\"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/10729b10d31fe46be449737d0a25a76598f7994e4b44a67056563d0715c3fa71?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"caption\":\"Frank Grasso\"},\"description\":\"I\u2019ve managed over $700 million in ad spend, contributing to billions in revenue. I say \\\"contributing\\\" because online success hinges on three key factors: a product people want, a price they\u2019re willing to pay, and timely delivery. The rest is about attention to detail. I'm not your typical digital advertising expert. My background is unconventional. I left school at 14 and worked as a mechanic until I was 33. In 2002, I leveraged my problem-solving skills to launch a $1 million Google Ads campaign for a travel client. This experience taught me how to optimize ad quality and campaign structure to reduce costs. Over time, I witnessed Google\u2019s evolution: from Sponsored Links to AdWords, then Shopping Ads, Smart Shopping, and finally PMax. As Google expanded its digital media dominance, I realized that my agency needed to adapt. That\u2019s when I shifted focus and sold my agency to start FeedOps. At FeedOps, my mission is to help eCommerce businesses sell more products, increase revenue, and reduce ad spend. We focus on relevance, the core of effective digital advertising. By ensuring your product data and ads are highly relevant to user intent, we help you spend less and gain more. Relevance drives everything from higher click-through rates to better conversion rates and lower costs. At FeedOps, we harness this principle to optimize your ads and product data, ensuring you achieve better returns on your advertising investments. My mission is to help advertisers scale their creativity and productivity, and to provide them with the best tools and solutions to reach their target audiences and achieve their goals. I am passionate about leveraging the latest technologies and trends to enhance the capabilities and performance of our software, and to deliver exceptional value and service to our clients. I am also committed to building and nurturing a talented and diverse team of digital marketers and software developers, who share my vision and values of excellence, collaboration, and customer satisfaction.\",\"sameAs\":[\"http:\/\/www.feedops.com\"],\"url\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/author\/frank-grasso\/\"}]}<\/script>\n<!-- \/ Yoast SEO Premium plugin. -->","yoast_head_json":{"title":"How To Optimize Shopping Feeds: What To Do First - FeedOps","description":"Asking how to optimize shopping feeds is crucial for performance marketers. Doing so helps increase online sales.","robots":{"index":"index","follow":"follow","max-snippet":"max-snippet:-1","max-image-preview":"max-image-preview:large","max-video-preview":"max-video-preview:-1"},"canonical":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/how-to-optimize-shopping-feeds\/","og_locale":"en_US","og_type":"article","og_title":"How To Optimize Shopping Feeds: What To Do First","og_description":"Asking how to optimize shopping feeds is crucial for performance marketers. Doing so helps increase online sales.","og_url":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/how-to-optimize-shopping-feeds\/","og_site_name":"FeedOps","article_publisher":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/feedops","article_published_time":"2023-02-11T00:36:44+00:00","article_modified_time":"2023-05-12T22:43:18+00:00","og_image":[{"width":2560,"height":1902,"url":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/feedops-playbook-with-optimiszation-score-4-scaled.jpeg","type":"image\/jpeg"}],"author":"Frank Grasso","twitter_card":"summary_large_image","twitter_misc":{"Written by":"Frank Grasso","Est. reading time":"4 minutes"},"schema":{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"Article","@id":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/how-to-optimize-shopping-feeds\/#article","isPartOf":{"@id":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/how-to-optimize-shopping-feeds\/"},"author":{"name":"Frank Grasso","@id":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#\/schema\/person\/935d648bb8def3c2afc809a576755608"},"headline":"How To Optimize Shopping Feeds: What To Do First","datePublished":"2023-02-11T00:36:44+00:00","dateModified":"2023-05-12T22:43:18+00:00","mainEntityOfPage":{"@id":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/how-to-optimize-shopping-feeds\/"},"wordCount":788,"publisher":{"@id":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#organization"},"image":{"@id":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/how-to-optimize-shopping-feeds\/#primaryimage"},"thumbnailUrl":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/feedops-playbook-with-optimiszation-score-4-scaled.jpeg","inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/how-to-optimize-shopping-feeds\/","url":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/how-to-optimize-shopping-feeds\/","name":"How To Optimize Shopping Feeds: What To Do First - FeedOps","isPartOf":{"@id":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#website"},"primaryImageOfPage":{"@id":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/how-to-optimize-shopping-feeds\/#primaryimage"},"image":{"@id":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/how-to-optimize-shopping-feeds\/#primaryimage"},"thumbnailUrl":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/feedops-playbook-with-optimiszation-score-4-scaled.jpeg","datePublished":"2023-02-11T00:36:44+00:00","dateModified":"2023-05-12T22:43:18+00:00","description":"Asking how to optimize shopping feeds is crucial for performance marketers. Doing so helps increase online sales.","breadcrumb":{"@id":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/how-to-optimize-shopping-feeds\/#breadcrumb"},"inLanguage":"en-US","potentialAction":[{"@type":"ReadAction","target":["https:\/\/feedops.com\/how-to-optimize-shopping-feeds\/"]}]},{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/how-to-optimize-shopping-feeds\/#primaryimage","url":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/feedops-playbook-with-optimiszation-score-4-scaled.jpeg","contentUrl":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/feedops-playbook-with-optimiszation-score-4-scaled.jpeg","width":2560,"height":1902},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","@id":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/how-to-optimize-shopping-feeds\/#breadcrumb","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"How To Optimize Shopping Feeds: What To Do First"}]},{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#website","url":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/","name":"FeedOps","description":"","publisher":{"@id":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#organization"},"potentialAction":[{"@type":"SearchAction","target":{"@type":"EntryPoint","urlTemplate":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/?s={search_term_string}"},"query-input":{"@type":"PropertyValueSpecification","valueRequired":true,"valueName":"search_term_string"}}],"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#organization","name":"FeedOps","url":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#\/schema\/logo\/image\/","url":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/Feedops-staggered-logo_Final-2-e1653522818889.png","contentUrl":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/Feedops-staggered-logo_Final-2-e1653522818889.png","width":899,"height":929,"caption":"FeedOps"},"image":{"@id":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#\/schema\/logo\/image\/"},"sameAs":["https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/feedops","https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/feedops\/","https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/@feedops"]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#\/schema\/person\/935d648bb8def3c2afc809a576755608","name":"Frank Grasso","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#\/schema\/person\/image\/","url":"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/10729b10d31fe46be449737d0a25a76598f7994e4b44a67056563d0715c3fa71?s=96&d=mm&r=g","contentUrl":"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/10729b10d31fe46be449737d0a25a76598f7994e4b44a67056563d0715c3fa71?s=96&d=mm&r=g","caption":"Frank Grasso"},"description":"I\u2019ve managed over $700 million in ad spend, contributing to billions in revenue. I say \"contributing\" because online success hinges on three key factors: a product people want, a price they\u2019re willing to pay, and timely delivery. The rest is about attention to detail. I'm not your typical digital advertising expert. My background is unconventional. I left school at 14 and worked as a mechanic until I was 33. In 2002, I leveraged my problem-solving skills to launch a $1 million Google Ads campaign for a travel client. This experience taught me how to optimize ad quality and campaign structure to reduce costs. Over time, I witnessed Google\u2019s evolution: from Sponsored Links to AdWords, then Shopping Ads, Smart Shopping, and finally PMax. As Google expanded its digital media dominance, I realized that my agency needed to adapt. That\u2019s when I shifted focus and sold my agency to start FeedOps. At FeedOps, my mission is to help eCommerce businesses sell more products, increase revenue, and reduce ad spend. We focus on relevance, the core of effective digital advertising. By ensuring your product data and ads are highly relevant to user intent, we help you spend less and gain more. Relevance drives everything from higher click-through rates to better conversion rates and lower costs. At FeedOps, we harness this principle to optimize your ads and product data, ensuring you achieve better returns on your advertising investments. My mission is to help advertisers scale their creativity and productivity, and to provide them with the best tools and solutions to reach their target audiences and achieve their goals. I am passionate about leveraging the latest technologies and trends to enhance the capabilities and performance of our software, and to deliver exceptional value and service to our clients. I am also committed to building and nurturing a talented and diverse team of digital marketers and software developers, who share my vision and values of excellence, collaboration, and customer satisfaction.","sameAs":["http:\/\/www.feedops.com"],"url":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/author\/frank-grasso\/"}]}},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1535","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/9"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1535"}],"version-history":[{"count":0,"href":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1535\/revisions"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/1541"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=1535"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=1535"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=1535"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}